<title>USA: Sonic Corp Q4 net shrinks with charge.</title>
<headline>Sonic Corp Q4 net shrinks with charge.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Okla. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended August 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.02		    $0.34</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.41		     0.34</p>
<p> Oper income		  729		    6,982</p>
<p> Net			    336		    4,030</p>
<p> Revs			46,021		   36,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,736		   11,865</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.84		    $1.05</p>
<p> Oper shr		    1.23		     1.05</p>
<p> Oper income	     18,539		   21,631</p>
<p> Net			 11,244		   12,484</p>
<p> Revs		     151,130		  123,760</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,449		   11,842</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 figures reflect a non-cash, after-tax charge of $5.3 million, or $0.39 per share, related to the adoption of a new accounting standard.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
